# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare dependencies {#declare-dependencies}"
msgstr "Déclarer les dépendances {#declare-dependencies}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A managed workflow runs in a Python environment that it prepares in advance. The job cannot reach the internet, so it cannot `pip install` packages. Instead, Qiskit and a list of [supported packages](#check-which-packages-are-installed) are already installed, and you can [upload wheels](#add-your-own-packages) for any other package that your workflow needs.\n"
msgstr "Un workflow géré s'exécute dans un environnement Python qu'il prépare à l'avance. Le job ne peut pas accéder à Internet, il ne peut donc pas faire de `pip install` de paquets. À la place, Qiskit et une liste de [paquets pris en charge](#check-which-packages-are-installed) sont déjà installés, et tu peux [téléverser des wheels](#add-your-own-packages) pour tout autre paquet dont ton workflow a besoin.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check which packages are installed {#check-which-packages-are-installed}"
msgstr "Vérifier quels paquets sont installés {#check-which-packages-are-installed}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every job runs with Python 3.12 on Linux (x86_64), with the following packages installed:\n"
msgstr "Chaque job s'exécute avec Python 3.12 sous Linux (x86_64), avec les paquets suivants installés :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless`, and their dependencies, such as `numpy`.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless` et leurs dépendances, comme `numpy`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The supported packages, such as `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-addon-sqd`, `qiskit-addon-utils`, `qiskit-mitigation`, `qiskit-addon-slc`, `qiskit-paulice`, `ffsim`, and `pyscf`. Each is installed at one fixed version.\n"
msgstr "Les paquets pris en charge, comme `qiskit-aer`, `qiskit-addon-sqd`, `qiskit-addon-utils`, `qiskit-mitigation`, `qiskit-addon-slc`, `qiskit-paulice`, `ffsim` et `pyscf`. Chacun est installé dans une version fixe.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see the supported packages and their versions, call `dependencies_versions()` from your local notebook:\n"
msgstr "Pour voir les paquets pris en charge et leurs versions, appelle `dependencies_versions()` depuis ton notebook local :\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependencies_versions() lists only requirements-dynamic-dependencies.txt. It omits qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, qiskit-serverless, and numpy, although they are installed. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependencies_versions() lists only requirements-dynamic-dependencies.txt. It omits qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, qiskit-serverless, and numpy, although they are installed. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your workflow can import any of these packages without setup. The workflow installs them when it builds the environment, not when a job starts, so they do not add to the start time of a job.\n"
msgstr "Ton workflow peut importer n'importe lequel de ces paquets sans configuration. Le workflow les installe lorsqu'il construit l'environnement, et non au démarrage d'un job, donc ils n'allongent pas le temps de démarrage d'un job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A workflow does not read a `requirements.txt` or `pyproject.toml` file, so it does not install the packages that these files list. The `dependencies` argument of `ManagedWorkflow` is deprecated and ignored, so it does not install packages either. Remove it from your upload code, and [upload wheels](#add-your-own-packages) instead.\n"
msgstr "Un workflow ne lit pas de fichier `requirements.txt` ni `pyproject.toml`, il n'installe donc pas les paquets que ces fichiers listent. L'argument `dependencies` de `ManagedWorkflow` est obsolète et ignoré, il n'installe donc pas non plus de paquets. Supprime-le de ton code de téléversement, et [téléverse plutôt des wheels](#add-your-own-packages).\n"

