# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add your own packages {#add-your-own-packages}"
msgstr "Ajouter tes propres paquets {#add-your-own-packages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a package that is not installed, collect its wheel files on your computer, upload them to the workflow's file storage, and install them at the start of the workflow. You upload them again only when they change.\n"
msgstr "Pour utiliser un paquet qui n'est pas installé, rassemble ses fichiers wheel sur ton ordinateur, téléverse-les dans le stockage de fichiers du workflow, et installe-les au début du workflow. Tu ne les téléverses à nouveau que lorsqu'ils changent.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build wheels {#build-wheels}"
msgstr "Construire des wheels {#build-wheels}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The job installs wheels without an internet connection, so each wheel must work with Python 3.12 on Linux (x86_64). Collect the wheels in one folder:\n"
msgstr "Le job installe les wheels sans connexion Internet, donc chaque wheel doit fonctionner avec Python 3.12 sur Linux (x86_64). Rassemble les wheels dans un seul dossier :\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`Local terminal`**\n"
msgstr "**`Local terminal`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With `--platform` and `--python-version`, `pip download` gets wheels for the job's platform, even when you run it on macOS or Windows. It also downloads the package's dependencies, such as `python-dateutil`, `six`, and `tzdata` for `pendulum`. Because the job installs each wheel without its dependencies, upload a wheel for every dependency that the environment lacks, and delete the other wheels from the folder.\n"
msgstr "Avec `--platform` et `--python-version`, `pip download` récupère les wheels pour la plateforme du job, même si tu l'exécutes sur macOS ou Windows. Il télécharge aussi les dépendances du paquet, comme `python-dateutil`, `six` et `tzdata` pour `pendulum`. Comme le job installe chaque wheel sans ses dépendances, téléverse une wheel pour chaque dépendance qui manque à l'environnement, et supprime les autres wheels du dossier.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A pure-Python wheel (`py3-none-any.whl`) works on any platform. If a package with compiled code has no Linux x86_64 wheel on PyPI, build one on Linux, for example in a `python:3.12` container. Keep the original file names, because `pip` reads the package name, version, and platform from them.\n"
msgstr "Une wheel en Python pur (`py3-none-any.whl`) fonctionne sur n'importe quelle plateforme. Si un paquet contenant du code compilé n'a pas de wheel Linux x86_64 sur PyPI, construis-en une sur Linux, par exemple dans un conteneur `python:3.12`. Conserve les noms de fichiers d'origine, car `pip` y lit le nom du paquet, la version et la plateforme.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload wheels {#upload-wheels}"
msgstr "Téléverser des wheels {#upload-wheels}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the wheels from your local notebook with `add_wheels()`:\n"
msgstr "Téléverse les wheels depuis ton notebook local avec `add_wheels()` :\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr "**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each path can be a file name or a glob pattern, and `add_wheels()` returns the names of the uploaded wheels. If a pattern matches no files, or matches a file that is not a `.whl` file, `add_wheels()` raises a `QiskitServerlessException`.\n"
msgstr "Chaque chemin peut être un nom de fichier ou un motif glob, et `add_wheels()` renvoie les noms des wheels téléversées. Si un motif ne correspond à aucun fichier, ou correspond à un fichier qui n'est pas un fichier `.whl`, `add_wheels()` lève une `QiskitServerlessException`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the workflow before you add wheels, because the wheels are stored with it. They go to a `wheels` folder in the workflow's [file storage](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows), separate from your other files.\n"
msgstr "Téléverse le workflow avant d'ajouter des wheels, car les wheels sont stockées avec lui. Elles vont dans un dossier `wheels` du [stockage de fichiers](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) du workflow, séparé de tes autres fichiers.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace or remove wheels {#replace-or-remove-wheels}"
msgstr "Remplacer ou supprimer des wheels {#replace-or-remove-wheels}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see the wheels that are uploaded to a workflow, call `list_wheels()`. To remove wheels, pass their file names to `remove_wheels()`:\n"
msgstr "Pour voir les wheels téléversées dans un workflow, appelle `list_wheels()`. Pour supprimer des wheels, passe leurs noms de fichiers à `remove_wheels()` :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To upgrade a package, remove the old wheel, and then add the new one. A new version has a different file name, so if you keep the old wheel, `install_uploaded_wheels()` installs both versions.\n"
msgstr "Pour mettre à niveau un paquet, supprime l'ancienne wheel, puis ajoute la nouvelle. Une nouvelle version a un nom de fichier différent ; si tu conserves l'ancienne wheel, `install_uploaded_wheels()` installe donc les deux versions.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install wheels in your workflow {#install-wheels-in-your-workflow}"
msgstr "Installer les wheels dans ton workflow {#install-wheels-in-your-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit your workflow code to call `install_uploaded_wheels()` before it imports the packages:\n"
msgstr "Modifie le code de ton workflow pour appeler `install_uploaded_wheels()` avant qu'il importe les paquets :\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"
msgstr "**`source_files/my_workflow.py`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`install_uploaded_wheels()` installs every wheel in the `wheels` folder. If the workflow has no wheels, the call does nothing. The wheels are installed again in every run, so a large set of wheels adds to the start time of each job.\n"
msgstr "`install_uploaded_wheels()` installe chaque wheel du dossier `wheels`. Si le workflow n'a aucune wheel, l'appel ne fait rien. Les wheels sont réinstallées à chaque exécution, donc un grand nombre de wheels allonge le temps de démarrage de chaque job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Best practice: bring only missing packages {#best-practice-bring-only-missing-packages}"
msgstr "Bonne pratique : n'apporte que les paquets manquants {#best-practice-bring-only-missing-packages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As a best practice, upload wheels only for the packages that the environment lacks. A wheel for an installed package, such as `numpy`, installs a second copy, and the code that imports it can get either copy. Errors from a mismatch appear only when the job runs.\n"
msgstr "Par bonne pratique, téléverse des wheels uniquement pour les paquets qui manquent à l'environnement. Une wheel pour un paquet déjà installé, comme `numpy`, installe une seconde copie, et le code qui l'importe peut obtenir l'une ou l'autre copie. Les erreurs dues à une incompatibilité n'apparaissent qu'à l'exécution du job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you upload, check your requirements with `dependency_report()` from your local notebook:\n"
msgstr "Avant de téléverser, vérifie tes dépendances avec `dependency_report()` depuis ton notebook local :\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependency_report() compares with dependencies_versions() only, so it reports numpy, qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, and qiskit-serverless as \"bring\", although the environment includes them (still true in qiskit-serverless 0.38.0). Fix the report, or keep the note after the list. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* REVIEW: dependency_report() compares with dependencies_versions() only, so it reports numpy, qiskit, qiskit-ibm-runtime, and qiskit-serverless as \"bring\", although the environment includes them (still true in qiskit-serverless 0.38.0). Fix the report, or keep the note after the list. */}\n"
"**`run_workflow_remotely.ipynb`**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The report gives each requirement one of the following statuses:\n"
msgstr "Le rapport attribue à chaque dépendance l'un des statuts suivants :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`baked`: The environment already provides the package. Do not upload a wheel for it.\n"
msgstr "`baked` : l'environnement fournit déjà le paquet. Ne téléverse pas de wheel pour celui-ci.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`bring`: The environment lacks the package. Upload a wheel for it.\n"
msgstr "`bring` : l'environnement ne contient pas le paquet. Téléverse une wheel pour celui-ci.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`clash`: The environment provides a different version. Change the version that your code requires, or rebuild your package for the installed version.\n"
msgstr "`clash` : l'environnement fournit une version différente. Change la version que ton code requiert, ou reconstruis ton paquet pour la version installée.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The report checks only the supported packages, so it shows `qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless`, and `numpy` as `bring`. The environment includes them, so do not upload wheels for them. The report shows `clash` only for an exact `==` version. It shows a range, such as `>=0.10`, as `baked`. The report does not upload any files.\n"
msgstr "Le rapport ne vérifie que les paquets pris en charge, il affiche donc `qiskit`, `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, `qiskit-serverless` et `numpy` comme `bring`. L'environnement les inclut, donc ne téléverse pas de wheels pour eux. Le rapport affiche `clash` uniquement pour une version exacte avec `==`. Il affiche une plage, comme `>=0.10`, comme `baked`. Le rapport ne téléverse aucun fichier.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshoot dependencies {#troubleshoot-dependencies}"
msgstr "Dépanner les dépendances {#troubleshoot-dependencies}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Problem | Cause |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| `pip install` fails inside the workflow. | The job cannot reach the internet. [Upload a wheel](#add-your-own-packages) instead. |\n"
"| `ModuleNotFoundError` for a package that you uploaded. | The workflow imports the package before it calls `install_uploaded_wheels()`. |\n"
"| `ModuleNotFoundError` for a dependency of a package that you uploaded. | Wheels are installed without their dependencies. Upload a wheel for the missing dependency. |\n"
"| The error says that a wheel `is not a supported wheel on this platform`. | The wheel is for another operating system or Python version. Get a wheel for Python 3.12 on Linux x86_64. |\n"
"| `install_uploaded_wheels()` fails with `ResolutionImpossible`. | The `wheels` folder has two versions of the same package. Remove the old wheel with [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
"| A CUDA package, such as `cupy`, fails on a GPU compute profile after you upload wheels. | A wheel replaced one of the [CUDA packages](#packages-on-gpu-compute-profiles) that the environment provides. Remove that wheel with [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
"| An installed package, such as `numpy`, fails after you upload wheels. | A wheel installed a second copy of a package that the environment provides. Remove that wheel with [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Problème | Cause |\n"
"| - | - |\n"
"| `pip install` échoue dans le workflow. | Le job ne peut pas accéder à Internet. [Téléverse plutôt une wheel](#add-your-own-packages). |\n"
"| `ModuleNotFoundError` pour un paquet que tu as téléversé. | Le workflow importe le paquet avant d'appeler `install_uploaded_wheels()`. |\n"
"| `ModuleNotFoundError` pour une dépendance d'un paquet que tu as téléversé. | Les wheels sont installées sans leurs dépendances. Téléverse une wheel pour la dépendance manquante. |\n"
"| L'erreur indique qu'une wheel `is not a supported wheel on this platform`. | La wheel est destinée à un autre système d'exploitation ou à une autre version de Python. Obtiens une wheel pour Python 3.12 sur Linux x86_64. |\n"
"| `install_uploaded_wheels()` échoue avec `ResolutionImpossible`. | Le dossier `wheels` contient deux versions du même paquet. Supprime l'ancienne wheel avec [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
"| Un paquet CUDA, comme `cupy`, échoue sur un profil de calcul GPU après le téléversement de wheels. | Une wheel a remplacé l'un des [paquets CUDA](#packages-on-gpu-compute-profiles) que fournit l'environnement. Supprime cette wheel avec [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
"| Un paquet installé, comme `numpy`, échoue après le téléversement de wheels. | Une wheel a installé une seconde copie d'un paquet que fournit l'environnement. Supprime cette wheel avec [`remove_wheels()`](#replace-or-remove-wheels). |\n"
